Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:42:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Item wear, repair, enchantments and the anvil for mods (round
 4 item 6, API 52)

recipe-types gains item-durability, item-set-damage, item-repairs-with,
item-enchantments and anvil-result, answered from the game's items and its
port of AnvilMenu.createResult. Harness: [max-damage], [repairs] and
[[anvil]] script tables. Example anvil-probe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
